===========================================================================
COMPANION-MOD-FRIENDLY PUBLIC APIs
===========================================================================

To enable a healthy companion-mod ecosystem, FSCore deliberately exposes
a public API surface under the `FSCore.API` table and the per-subsystem
`FSCore<Subsystem>.API` tables. Companion mod authors are encouraged to
build on these APIs. The API call signatures and event-bus contracts are
the supported integration surface.

Building a companion mod that calls FSCore.API.*, subscribes to
FSCore.subscribe(...), or registers via the documented extension points
(role registration, satellite namespace registration, etc.) does NOT
constitute "copying any portion of the Work" under section 1 above.
The API itself is the integration boundary.

